01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-ACTION LK-C-DAY LK-T-DAY LK-KNOWN-YEAR LK-OUT-YEAR LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS WS-STATUS
    SET Z-HEAD Z-TAIL TO NULL
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-ACTION)
        WHEN "ANCHOR"
            PERFORM ANCHOR-5000
        WHEN "NEXT"
            MOVE LK-KNOWN-YEAR TO WS-YEAR
            PERFORM NEXT-YEAR
        WHEN "PREVIOUS"
            MOVE LK-KNOWN-YEAR TO WS-YEAR
            PERFORM PREVIOUS-YEAR
        WHEN "FIND"
            PERFORM ANCHOR-5000
            IF LK-STATUS = 0 PERFORM WALK-TO-TARGET END-IF
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 160 TO LK-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    IF LK-STATUS = 0 MOVE WS-YEAR TO LK-OUT-YEAR END-IF
    GOBACK.

ANCHOR-5000.
    MOVE LK-C-DAY TO WS-A MOVE -5778 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-LOW-DAY
    MOVE LK-C-DAY TO WS-A MOVE 5778 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-HIGH-DAY

    MOVE "AT-BEFORE" TO WS-GATE-ACTION
    CALL "NORMATIVE-GATES" USING WS-GATE-ACTION WS-LOW-DAY WS-START-IDX WS-I-DAY WS-FOUND WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE "AT-AFTER" TO WS-GATE-ACTION
    CALL "NORMATIVE-GATES" USING WS-GATE-ACTION WS-HIGH-DAY WS-END-IDX WS-J-DAY WS-FOUND WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF

    MOVE 0 TO WS-CAND-COUNT
    MOVE WS-START-IDX TO WS-I-IDX
ANCHOR-I-LOOP.
    MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-A MOVE WS-END-IDX TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP >= 0 GO TO ANCHOR-CANDIDATES-DONE END-IF
    PERFORM GET-I-DAY
    MOVE WS-I-DAY TO WS-A MOVE LK-C-DAY TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP >= 0 GO TO ANCHOR-I-NEXT END-IF
    MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-A MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-J-IDX
ANCHOR-J-LOOP.
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WS-A MOVE WS-END-IDX TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP > 0 GO TO ANCHOR-I-NEXT END-IF
    PERFORM GET-J-DAY
    MOVE WS-J-DAY TO WS-A MOVE WS-I-DAY TO WS-B PERFORM SUB-A-B MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A
    MOVE 5778 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM CMP-A-SMALL
    IF WS-CMP > 0 GO TO ANCHOR-I-NEXT END-IF
    MOVE WS-A TO WS-OUT
    PERFORM TO-SMALL-A
    MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-LENGTH
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WS-A MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-B PERFORM SUB-A-B MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A PERFORM TO-SMALL-A
    MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-GAPS
    IF WS-GAPS >= 6 AND WS-LENGTH >= 252
        MOVE WS-J-DAY TO WS-A MOVE LK-C-DAY TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
        IF WS-CMP >= 0
            ADD 1 TO WS-CAND-COUNT
            IF WS-CAND-COUNT > 40000 MOVE 161 TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
            MOVE WS-LENGTH TO WC-LENGTH(WS-CAND-COUNT)
            MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WC-OPEN-IDX(WS-CAND-COUNT)
            MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WC-CLOSE-IDX(WS-CAND-COUNT)
        END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WS-A MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-J-IDX
    GO TO ANCHOR-J-LOOP.
ANCHOR-I-NEXT.
    MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-A MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-I-IDX
    GO TO ANCHOR-I-LOOP.
ANCHOR-CANDIDATES-DONE.
    IF WS-CAND-COUNT < 1 MOVE 162 TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE LK-C-DAY TO WS-SAUCETARGET
    MOVE 10 TO WS-SEAL
    PERFORM PICK-RANK-SMALL
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF

    MOVE 0 TO WS-SORTED-POS
    PERFORM VARYING WS-LENGTH-SCAN FROM 252 BY 1 UNTIL WS-LENGTH-SCAN > 5778
        PERFORM VARYING WS-C FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-C > WS-CAND-COUNT
            IF WC-LENGTH(WS-C) = WS-LENGTH-SCAN
                ADD 1 TO WS-SORTED-POS
                IF WS-SORTED-POS = WS-RANK-SMALL
                    MOVE WC-OPEN-IDX(WS-C) TO WS-I-IDX
                    MOVE WC-CLOSE-IDX(WS-C) TO WS-J-IDX
                    GO TO ANCHOR-CHOSEN
                END-IF
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE 163 TO LK-STATUS
    EXIT PARAGRAPH.
ANCHOR-CHOSEN.
    MOVE 5000 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM MAKE-SMALL-OUT MOVE WS-OUT TO WY-NUMBER
    MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WY-OPEN-INDEX
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WY-CLOSE-INDEX
    PERFORM GET-I-DAY MOVE WS-I-DAY TO WY-OPEN-DAY
    PERFORM GET-J-DAY MOVE WS-J-DAY TO WY-CLOSE-DAY.

NEXT-YEAR.
    MOVE WY-CLOSE-INDEX TO WS-I-IDX
    MOVE WY-CLOSE-DAY TO WS-I-DAY
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CAND-COUNT
    MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-A MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-J-IDX
NEXT-CAND-LOOP.
    PERFORM GET-J-DAY
    MOVE WS-J-DAY TO WS-A MOVE WS-I-DAY TO WS-B PERFORM SUB-A-B MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A
    MOVE 5778 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM CMP-A-SMALL
    IF WS-CMP > 0 GO TO NEXT-CAND-DONE END-IF
    PERFORM TO-SMALL-A MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-LENGTH
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WS-A MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-B PERFORM SUB-A-B MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A PERFORM TO-SMALL-A MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-GAPS
    IF WS-GAPS >= 6 AND WS-LENGTH >= 252
        ADD 1 TO WS-CAND-COUNT
        MOVE WS-LENGTH TO WC-LENGTH(WS-CAND-COUNT)
        MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WC-OPEN-IDX(WS-CAND-COUNT)
        MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WC-CLOSE-IDX(WS-CAND-COUNT)
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WS-A MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-J-IDX
    GO TO NEXT-CAND-LOOP.
NEXT-CAND-DONE.
    IF WS-CAND-COUNT < 1 MOVE 164 TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE WY-CLOSE-DAY TO WS-SAUCETARGET
    MOVE 11 TO WS-SEAL
    PERFORM PICK-RANK-SMALL
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE WC-CLOSE-IDX(WS-RANK-SMALL) TO WS-J-IDX
    MOVE WY-NUMBER TO WS-A MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WY-NUMBER
    MOVE WY-CLOSE-INDEX TO WY-OPEN-INDEX
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WY-CLOSE-INDEX
    MOVE WY-CLOSE-DAY TO WY-OPEN-DAY
    PERFORM GET-J-DAY MOVE WS-J-DAY TO WY-CLOSE-DAY.

PREVIOUS-YEAR.
    MOVE WY-OPEN-INDEX TO WS-J-IDX
    MOVE WY-OPEN-DAY TO WS-J-DAY
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CAND-COUNT
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WS-A MOVE -1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-I-IDX
PREV-CAND-LOOP.
    PERFORM GET-I-DAY
    MOVE WS-J-DAY TO WS-A MOVE WS-I-DAY TO WS-B PERFORM SUB-A-B MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A
    MOVE 5778 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM CMP-A-SMALL
    IF WS-CMP > 0 GO TO PREV-CAND-DONE END-IF
    PERFORM TO-SMALL-A MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-LENGTH
    MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WS-A MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-B PERFORM SUB-A-B MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A PERFORM TO-SMALL-A MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-GAPS
    IF WS-GAPS >= 6 AND WS-LENGTH >= 252
        ADD 1 TO WS-CAND-COUNT
        MOVE WS-LENGTH TO WC-LENGTH(WS-CAND-COUNT)
        MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WC-OPEN-IDX(WS-CAND-COUNT)
        MOVE WS-J-IDX TO WC-CLOSE-IDX(WS-CAND-COUNT)
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WS-A MOVE -1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-I-IDX
    GO TO PREV-CAND-LOOP.
PREV-CAND-DONE.
    IF WS-CAND-COUNT < 1 MOVE 165 TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE WY-OPEN-DAY TO WS-SAUCETARGET
    MOVE 12 TO WS-SEAL
    PERFORM PICK-RANK-SMALL
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE WC-OPEN-IDX(WS-RANK-SMALL) TO WS-I-IDX
    MOVE WY-NUMBER TO WS-A MOVE -1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM ADD-SMALL-A MOVE WS-OUT TO WY-NUMBER
    MOVE WY-OPEN-INDEX TO WY-CLOSE-INDEX
    MOVE WS-I-IDX TO WY-OPEN-INDEX
    MOVE WY-OPEN-DAY TO WY-CLOSE-DAY
    PERFORM GET-I-DAY MOVE WS-I-DAY TO WY-OPEN-DAY.

WALK-TO-TARGET.
WALK-FORWARD-CHECK.
    MOVE LK-T-DAY TO WS-A MOVE WY-CLOSE-DAY TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP > 0
        PERFORM NEXT-YEAR
        IF LK-STATUS = 0 GO TO WALK-FORWARD-CHECK END-IF
    END-IF
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
WALK-BACKWARD-CHECK.
    MOVE LK-T-DAY TO WS-A MOVE WY-OPEN-DAY TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP <= 0
        PERFORM PREVIOUS-YEAR
        IF LK-STATUS = 0 GO TO WALK-BACKWARD-CHECK END-IF
    END-IF.

PICK-RANK-SMALL.
    CALL "NORMATIVE-SAUCE" USING LK-C-DAY WS-SAUCETARGET WS-BOWLS WS-ORDER WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    CALL "NORMATIVE-ASK" USING WS-BOWLS WS-ORDER WS-BOWL-ID WS-SEAL WS-FIRST WS-STEP WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE WS-CAND-COUNT TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM MAKE-SMALL-OUT MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-N
    CALL "NORMATIVE-CHOOSE-RANK" USING WS-FIRST WS-STEP WS-N WS-RANK WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS EXIT PARAGRAPH END-IF
    MOVE WS-RANK TO WS-A PERFORM TO-SMALL-A MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-RANK-SMALL.

GET-I-DAY.
    MOVE "INDEX" TO WS-GATE-ACTION
    CALL "NORMATIVE-GATES" USING WS-GATE-ACTION WS-I-IDX WS-OUT WS-I-DAY WS-FOUND WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
GET-J-DAY.
    MOVE "INDEX" TO WS-GATE-ACTION
    CALL "NORMATIVE-GATES" USING WS-GATE-ACTION WS-J-IDX WS-OUT WS-J-DAY WS-FOUND WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
MAKE-SMALL-OUT.
    MOVE "FROM-SMALL" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-ZERO WS-ZERO WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
ADD-SMALL-A.
    MOVE "ADD-SMALL" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-ZERO WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
SUB-A-B.
    MOVE "SUB" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
CMP-A-B.
    MOVE "CMP" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
CMP-A-SMALL.
    MOVE "CMP-SMALL" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-ZERO WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
TO-SMALL-A.
    MOVE "TO-SMALL" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-ZERO WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
END PROGRAM NORMATIVE-YEAR.
